Windows Driver Installation Guide

1. Navigate to the `libusb-AICE-driver` folder.
2. Right-click on `Install_driver.exe`.
3. Select Run as Administrator to begin the installation.

Note: If Windows Security prompts with "Would you like to install this device software?" 
during the installation, click `Install`.

After installation, verify that "Device Manager" lists `libusbK USB Devices`.

